Bundled 72×72 PNGs from Twemoji 15.1.0 (renamed for the heat / listen states):

  1f642.png  🙂  slightly smiling face           →  faces/calm.png
  1f62c.png  😬  grimacing face                  →  faces/rising.png
  1f621.png  😡  pouting face                    →  faces/hot.png
  1f3a7.png  🎧  headphone                       →  headphones/on.png

headphones/off.png is a dimmed copy of 1f3a7 (cans set aside — not listening).
It is not a separate Twemoji glyph.

Calm is the simple slightly-smiling face (no blush). Blushy / laughing faces
are not the baseline. Listen vs pause is headphones on (worn on the circle)
vs headphones off (set down on the grey disc).
